    {
      "name": "Iron Lock: Counterseal",
      "trigger": "on_defense_win",
      "description": "A successful Defense marks the opponent for 2 turns. If they Attack while marked, Drakoryn counters for 20% Attack true damage and clears the mark. If they use Stamina while marked, Drakoryn steals 1 Stability and clears the mark. Defense leaves the mark untouched. 3-turn cooldown to re-arm; only one payoff per mark.",
